1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,290
A robot copies a person closing a laptop, yet the screen follows the wrong motion.
机器人模仿人关电脑，屏幕却没有按预期运动。

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:10,690
FoLD uses the object-motion error to guide corrections to the robot fingers.
FoLD利用物体运动误差指导机器人手指修正。

3
00:00:11,532 --> 00:00:17,432
Human demonstrations provide hand trajectories and the desired motion of an articulated object.
人类示范提供手轨迹和铰接物体的期望运动。

4
00:00:17,992 --> 00:00:23,232
An imitator retargets the motion, supplying a baseline that a residual policy can adjust.
模仿器重定向运动，残差策略在此基础上调整。

5
00:00:23,881 --> 00:00:29,421
When the object deviates, the method estimates a virtual compensatory force field.
物体偏离参考时，方法估计虚拟补偿力场。

6
00:00:29,901 --> 00:00:35,741
Current interaction state and contact structure describe what correction would better reproduce the demonstrated motion.
当前交互状态与接触结构描述所需运动修正。

7
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:41,035
An encoder compresses this field into information for the residual policy.
编码器把力场压缩为残差策略的输入信息。

8
00:00:41,435 --> 00:00:46,555
During evaluation, it does not secretly push the object with an external corrective force.
评测时不会用外部补偿力直接推动物体。

9
00:00:47,226 --> 00:00:53,006
The policy changes the robot action so its own contacts can produce the desired object behavior.
策略改变机器人动作，由自身接触实现目标物体运动。

10
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:59,326
This requires known models, interaction states, and task-specific training within the simulated setup.
这依赖已知模型、交互状态和仿真中的任务专门训练。

11
00:00:59,953 --> 00:01:05,493
The main reported success measure is completed trajectory length divided by reference length.
主表所谓成功指标，是完成轨迹长度除以参考长度。

12
00:01:05,953 --> 00:01:12,053
An attempt is truncated when positional error exceeds fifteen centimeters or rotation error exceeds forty degrees.
位置超过15厘米或转角超过40度时截断。

13
00:01:12,687 --> 00:01:20,167
Across twenty-seven paired hand-task units, completion ratio is point seven seven two versus point six zero six.
27个配对手型任务单元，完成比例0.772对0.606。

14
00:01:20,707 --> 00:01:25,647
Average articulation error falls from thirty-one point zero six to fourteen point eight three degrees.
平均铰接误差从31.06度降到14.83度。

15
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:33,460
The physical laptop-closing and headphone-folding demonstrations replay trajectories without autonomous sensory feedback.
真机关电脑和折耳机采用无自主感知反馈的轨迹回放。

16
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:39,100
They support execution feasibility, not validated closed-loop real-world task success.
它们支持执行可行性，尚不能证明真机闭环成功。

17
00:01:39,671 --> 00:01:45,411
FoLD shifts attention from matching hand geometry to producing the intended object motion.
FoLD把关注点从手形相似转向物体运动效果。

18
00:01:45,731 --> 00:01:51,691
Results are not uniformly better across hands, so inspect the per-embodiment rows before generalizing.
并非所有手型都更优，结论要保留逐手型差异。
